        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anna Faris, Regina Hall, Shawn Wayans, Marlon Wayans, Tim Curry, Tori Spelling, Chris Elliott, Chris Masterson, Kathleen Robertson, David Cross, James Woods\n- Products: Scary Movie 2, Scary Movie film series\n- Roles: Cindy Campbell\n- Places: Washington, Seattle\n- Organizations: Seattle Repertory Theater\n\nFacts:\n- Anna Faris was raised north of Seattle in Washington.\n- Anna Faris performed with the Seattle Repertory Theater at age nine and was active in theater as a child.\n- Anna Faris rose to prominence for comedic roles, especially as Cindy Campbell in the first four Scary Movie films.\n- Scary Movie 2 stars Anna Faris, Regina Hall, Shawn Wayans, and Marlon Wayans, who reprised their roles from the first film despite their characters having been killed off.\n- Scary Movie 2 also stars Tim Curry, Tori Spelling, Chris Elliott, Chris Masterson, Kathleen Robertson, David Cross, and James Woods.",
